earth-land-points.json

Land sample points for the APVIS Nucleus globe, generated by
scripts/generate-earth-points.py from Natural Earth ne_50m_land
(https://www.naturalearthdata.com, via github.com/nvkelso/natural-earth-vector).

atlas-uk-coast.json

UK and Ireland coastline polylines for the Atlas map, generated by
scripts/generate-atlas-coast.py from the same Natural Earth ne_50m_land file.

Natural Earth data is in the public domain: "All versions of Natural Earth
raster + vector map data found on this website are in the public domain."
The source file's SHA-256 is recorded inside each JSON file.

world-land.json

World land outlines for the OSIRIS world Atlas, generated by
scripts/generate-world-land.py from Natural Earth ne_110m_land (same source,
same public-domain terms).

world-borders.json

Country border lines for the Atlas globe, generated by
scripts/generate-world-borders.py from Natural Earth ne_110m_admin_0_boundary_lines_land
(same source, same public-domain terms).
